      "description": {
        "fun": "Charmeleon is the family's hothead: it goes looking for opponents, and a strong one excites it so much that it spouts bluish-white flames that scorch everything around. Just swinging its tail raises the temperature to unbearable levels. Once it has won, though, it calms right down, and it naps with its hands behind its head, all that fierceness gone.",
        "guide": "The middle stage of Charmander's line, a dark red lizard Pokémon with a horn on the back of its head and sharp claws. It is aggressive and seeks out strong opponents, spouting bluish-white flames when excited, but relaxes once it wins. It evolves into Charizard.",
