      "description": {
        "fun": "Charizard flies the skies in search of a worthy opponent, but it never turns its fire on anyone weaker than itself. Its tail flame burns hotter the more experience it gains, and turns blue when it's irritated. Voted the most popular Generation 1 Pokémon in The Pokémon Company's 2020 poll, it has also had more makeovers than most: two Mega Evolutions and a Gigantamax form.",
        "guide": "A large, orange, dragon-like Fire and Flying Pokémon and the final stage of Charmander's line. It flies in search of strong opponents, and its fiery breath can melt boulders, though it never turns it on weaker foes. Charizard has two Mega Evolutions, Mega Charizard X and Y, and a Gigantamax form.",
        "tagline": "A fire-breathing dragon that only picks fights with equals",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Charizard (Pokémon)",
